  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ca&#x302;m Dairy -  a Nigerian dairy company that is working to aggregate raw milk collected from dairying communities and processing it into packaged pasteurized fresh milk, which it delivers to consumers. It is driven by a vision to lead Nigeria to reach self-sufficiency in dairy production to meet the nutritional needs of its people; to provide women with sustainable incomes; and to lift smallholder households out of poverty.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Develop an inventory management system&#xA0;that tracks raw materials and finished products from farm to customer. Inventory management is a key risk&#xA0;area,&#xA0;and a&#xA0;digitized&#xA0;system will help reduce risks. Through the inventory system, Cam Dairy will be able to track and&#xA0;visualize&#xA0;key indicators such as demand, inbound supply, production, outbound supply, and sales. Enhanced tracking of supplies and sales will help reduce food wastage and increase demand for pastoralists&#x2019; milk.</narrative>
  </description>
